This repository contains a GitHub Action ("the Action") that installs and
invokes the Bitwarden Secrets Manager command-line tool ("bws"). The Action
does not include or redistribute bws; it downloads the official bws release
from Bitwarden at runtime.

The Action is provided for use solely in connection with the Bitwarden Secrets
Manager CLI and is subject to the Bitwarden Software Development Kit License
Agreement, Version 1 (17 March 2023), available at:

    https://github.com/bitwarden/sdk-sm/blob/main/LICENSE

No rights broader than those granted by that Agreement are conferred by this
repository. To the extent this repository's own source (the Action definition
and the scripts in bin/) is separable from bws, it is made available under the
same terms and no more permissively.

THE ACTION IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM,
DAMAGES, OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM, OUT OF, OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE
ACTION OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE ACTION.
